# RPC endpoint used by test/fork/*.t.sol (vm.createSelectFork, pinned to a fixed block for
# reproducibility). Fork tests fail loudly if this is unset rather than silently skipping,
# so `forge test` never gives false confidence.
#
# Must be an archive-capable endpoint. The public https://arb1.arbitrum.io/rpc only retains
# ~6,000-8,000 blocks (~30 min) of state, which isn't enough to pin a block reliably — use a
# free-tier key from Alchemy, Infura, or QuickNode instead.
ARBITRUM_RPC_URL=https://arb-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_API_KEY
